{
  "info": {
    "name": "07 — Materials authoring, review and delivery",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Typed Manager CRUD, assigned Mentor context/draft/submit and Manager review/publication. Login cookie jar; mutations require Origin matching CORS_ORIGINS. Queue filters reviewStatus/courseUnitId/contentType; open detail to obtain expectedRevision. Reject with trimmed nonempty reason, Mentor EDIT/resubmit, then approve. Approval publishes; unpublish keeps approval and approve retry does not republish. Manual Class Unit locks/schedules were removed on 2026-10-22; ACTIVE enrollment grants class access after payment confirmation. Requires migration 1792627200001. Phase 3.4 staff preview: POST .../files/{{preview_file_id}}/access with Origin and body {} returns a <=60s signed URL for a referenced file (primary/inline image/attachment); Manager any live material, Mentor published or own unapproved draft. Refetch on 409 and compare; never automatically approve a new revision. Local verified; VPS acceptance pending. Requires migrations through 1791856800000."
  },
